      "updated": 1786917570705,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Supervised Data\n* Expert labelled data\n* Free-availability \"not-safe-for-work\" dataset (online)\n\nSemi-supervised Data\n* User Reports\n\nSelf-Supervised Data\n* Post comments\n\n==> need sampling to balance! use a combination of balanced sampling during training and loss\nweighting to fine-tune the precision-recall tradeoff, but for now we'll acknowledge this as an\nimportant consideration and earmark it for later discussion.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Supervised Data\n* Expert labelled data\n* Free-availability \"not-safe-for-work\" dataset (online)\n\nSemi-supervised Data\n* User Reports\n\nSelf-Supervised Data\n* Post comments\n\n==> need sampling to balance! use a combination of balanced sampling during training and loss weighting to fine-tune the precision-recall tradeoff, but for now we'll acknowledge this as an important consideration and earmark it for later discussion.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
