      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Content Features\n* All text (body, hashtag, etc)\n* Images/videos\n\nBehaviral Features\nRealtime tallies\n* negative reactions/views\n* shares/view\n\nUser Features\n* trained user embedding\n* age of account\n* Laast N posting of harmful content",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Content Features\n* All text (body, hashtag, etc)\n* Images/videos\n\nBehaviral Features\nRealtime tallies\n* negative reactions/views\n* shares/view\n\nUser Features\n* trained user embedding\n* age of account\n* Laast N posting of harmful content",
