      "text": "Model Architecture\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Model Architecture\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "n5wREDG9BOMk6vxvd7lS4",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 1185.0424107142858,
      "y": 1524.1875,
      "width": 654.7862723214283,
      "height": 517.1795662905499,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2059894400,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 452628096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786920410713,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "status": "saved",
      "fileId": "99c27241f8f640ffae52f33f8168f25de2a548e9",
      "scale": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3Hun0GdfNWtaqgluxv9Po",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1890.433001620641,
      "y": 1486.8465437457887,
      "width": 571.1553249188781,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 423811456,
      "version": 337,
      "versionNonce": 1907083648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786921133522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Model Architecture consists of 3 components:\n\n1. Multi-modal Encoder\n* A vision transformer (ViT) for processing image patches\n* A text tokenizer and encoder for processing the post\nbody, hashtags, etc.\n* Cross-attention layers to combine modalities\n* Additional embedding layers for behavioral and user\nfeatures\n\n2. Lightweight update network\n* A small network that can efficiently merge dense,\nbehavioral inputs with the heavy content-specific\nembeddings\n* Takes the original model's embedding and new behavioral\nfeatures as input\n\n\n3. Classification Heads\n* Multiple classification heads for different tasks we'll\nengineer (talk about this in a second)\n* Shared representation layers to leverage common\npatterns\n* Calibration layer to ensure precision requirements are\nmet",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Model Architecture consists of 3 components:\n\n1. Multi-modal Encoder\n* A vision transformer (ViT) for processing image patches\n* A text tokenizer and encoder for processing the post body, hashtags, etc.\n* Cross-attention layers to combine modalities\n* Additional embedding layers for behavioral and user features\n\n2. Lightweight update network\n* A small network that can efficiently merge dense, behavioral inputs with the heavy content-specific embeddings\n* Takes the original model's embedding and new behavioral features as input\n\n\n3. Classification Heads\n* Multiple classification heads for different tasks we'll engineer (talk about this in a second)\n* Shared representation layers to leverage common patterns\n* Calibration layer to ensure precision requirements are met",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3RVl7tQLYEsgup1f1ykth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1183.366297000184,
      "y": 2070.353922892622,
      "width": 132.53988647460938,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 381356416,
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 549830272,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786921158201,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Loss function\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Loss function\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QvNv7q1zt-FeslWd6wyyg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1174.8024061105439,
      "y": 2101.120409074992,
      "width": 668.5454820728189,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 9009536,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 529739392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786921202412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Classification Performance: Binary cross-entropy loss for the\nmain classification task which is used to discriminate between\nharmful and benign content.\n\n2. View-weighted Loss: business objective is focused on content\nthat gets views, not all content. We'll weight the loss by the\npotential view count to align with our business objective and focus\non content that is more likely to be harmful and viewed.",
      "fontSize": 20,
